#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:1 a280934d58124b528160365240e530f7
msgid "ARX Lift 2S"
msgstr "方舟无限 Lift 2S"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:3 4b9017883b42439cb52e70aa47c18cb5
msgid ""
"**ARX** (方舟无限) is the brand. **Lift 2S** is that brand’s full-body **mobile "
"manipulator**: arms **plus** lift axis and **mobile base / chassis**, not an"
" arm-only robot."
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限**（ARX）是品牌。**Lift 2S** 是该品牌的全身 **移动操作臂**：手臂 **加上** 升降轴和 "
"**移动底盘**，不是仅机械臂的机器人。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:5 c7951adb5f404349b9f14744720e3009
msgid ""
"**Acone** / **AC One** is the **arm portion** of the same stack (manipulator"
" only). It is not the Lift 2S platform. The `arx-lift2s` workspace can "
"launch Acone from `quick_start` for co-debug; the product focus of that "
"branch is Lift 2S."
msgstr ""
"**Acone** / **AC One** 是同一套栈中的 **机械臂部分**（仅操作臂）。它不是 Lift 2S 整机。`arx-lift2s` "
"工作空间可在 `quick_start` 中启动 Acone 做联调；该分支的产品重点是 Lift 2S。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:7 adf62679bba14d2ba85e785d44148b68
msgid ""
"Brand labels follow [robot_usds README_zh-CN.md "
"§3.1](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README_zh-"
"CN.md#31-中文简称与英文标识对照): 方舟无限 = ARX. Do not use bare “Ark” as the brand name."
msgstr ""
"品牌标注遵循 [robot_usds README_zh-CN.md §3.1](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README_zh-CN.md#31-中文简称与英文标识对照)：方舟无限 = ARX。不要用单独的 "
"“Ark” 当品牌名。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:9 5e61a60c0a3446b395a390fa7842022c
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "以源仓库为准"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:12 2544d3cd9e2741cb97b6b18ec39bad45
msgid "Follow the branch README. Do not invent extra launch flags."
msgstr "遵循分支 README。不要编造额外的 launch 参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:14 e9a07df583c543ce9578813abfb38e26
msgid ""
"Chinese: [open-deploy-ws `arx-lift2s` README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"中文：[open-deploy-ws `arx-lift2s` README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:15 8613a2503fed4ec59f82afaffc08c87c
msgid ""
"English: [README.EN.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.EN.md)"
msgstr ""
"英文：[README.EN.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-"
"lift2s/README.EN.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:18 8fa94ce3b7a74ddcb0cbe84141cd84d3
msgid "Clone and init"
msgstr "克隆与初始化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:20 fdd60b84e04d46fe8af248d662dbc85e
msgid "From the README (directory name `lift2s-ws` is the example):"
msgstr "来自 README（目录名 `lift2s-ws` 为示例）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:22 6737eeba00b94a8888ce5f9800cb9dfb
msgid ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:29 544bc631a8e446c4bbf98686a5e9a3ce
msgid ""
"Field zip (README): unzip, then `./release.sh --install`, then "
"`./quick_start.sh`. Descriptions stay as source; controllers / hardware "
"interface come from `.deb`."
msgstr ""
"现场 zip（README）：解压后执行 `./release.sh --install`，再执行 "
"`./quick_start.sh`。描述保持源码；控制器 / 硬件接口来自 `.deb`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:31 f02c3398b78a4aacb8a21d7baf1e6360
msgid "Build and launch (scripts first)"
msgstr "编译与启动（脚本优先）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:33 9d22876180604289a6c02ac337131564
msgid ""
"Primary path is `./quick_start.sh` (scenario build + Lift2S split/full body,"
" simulation or real):"
msgstr "主路径是 `./quick_start.sh`（按场景编译 + Lift2S 分身/全身，仿真或真机）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:35 96a8a2fb399142e3aa16b4418fefe6f1
msgid ""
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:40 baf95387124b49b5b13ef894a791e495
msgid "README menu:"
msgstr "README 菜单："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:42 0a403355b72c430cafb989b037b7ed02
msgid ""
"**Build** — simulation packages, or real-hardware packages (includes "
"`arx_ros2_control`)"
msgstr "**编译** — 仿真软件包，或真机软件包（含 `arx_ros2_control`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:43 39dcfa8cada54494a52d6734ee161612
msgid ""
"**Launch** — choose **Lift2S**, then **split body** or **full body**, then "
"simulation (`mock_components`) or **real hardware**"
msgstr ""
"**启动** — 选择 **Lift2S**，再选 **分身** 或 **全身**，然后仿真（`mock_components`）或 **真机**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:45 c04a1f7cf04448bf940acd42037c2002
msgid ""
"CAN (README): left/right arms `can1` / `can3`; no network IP. Lift axis "
"defaults to `hybrid` (change to `soft_p` in `quick_start`)."
msgstr ""
"CAN（README）：左右臂 `can1` / `can3`；没有网络 IP。升降轴默认 `hybrid`（可在 `quick_start` 中改为 "
"`soft_p`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:47 68962174b523433d90d4f8a1f541bd51
msgid ""
"X5 / R5 / **ACone** / Lift / X7S in the same menu are `robot-descriptions-"
"arx` models for **co-debug**. Pick **ACone** only when you want the **arm**,"
" not the full Lift 2S chassis."
msgstr ""
"同一菜单中的 X5 / R5 / **ACone** / Lift / X7S 是用于 **联调** 的 `robot-descriptions-"
"arx` 模型。只有在需要 **机械臂**、而不是完整 Lift 2S 底盘时才选 **ACone**。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:49 458b49cf47214182a3acd80e7e668d85
msgid "Optional README launch lines"
msgstr "README 中的可选 launch 行"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:51 eeaf09f19f414c748ad972d9676f0534
msgid ""
"Prefer the script. These are the README’s optional equivalents for "
"**Lift2S**:"
msgstr "优先用脚本。以下是 README 中 **Lift2S** 的可选等价命令："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:53 a3bfba2fc0a84affabb3e9f2dd9cfe0a
msgid ""
"source ~/lift2s-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"# Visualization\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Split body / full body (add hardware:=real for the robot)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s"
msgstr ""
"source ~/lift2s-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"# Visualization\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Split body / full body (add hardware:=real for the robot)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/11-arx_lift2s.md:62 f89668f07f864a66b591bed295e766d0
msgid ""
"Zenoh: README asks for `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` and "
"`export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` on the deploy host."
msgstr ""
"Zenoh：README 要求在部署主机上执行 `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` 并 `export"
" RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`。"

